    remaining = bins - item
    return np.where(remaining < 0, -np.inf, -np.exp(remaining ** 2))
```

{The algorithm calculates priority as the squared ratio of the item size to the bin capacity, penalizing bins that cannot accommodate the item with negative infinity.}

